## Architecture

### App Structure

```
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ Application State (App) │
├─────────────────────────┤
│ - screen_state: Tab     │
│ - selection: TableState │
│ - data: Snapshot        │
│ - async_state: Arc<Mutex<>>
└────────┬────────────────┘
         │
         ├─→ UI Rendering (render())
         ├─→ Event Loop (handle_event())
         └─→ Data Loading (load_data())
```

### Key Data Structures

```rust
pub struct App {
    // UI State
    pub current_tab: usize,
    pub table_state: TableState,

    // Business Logic State
    pub data: {{DataStruct}},

    // Async State
    pub async_operation: Arc<Mutex<AsyncState>>,
}

pub struct {{DataStruct}} {
    {{field1}}: {{Type}},
    {{field2}}: {{Type}},
}
```

### Widget Hierarchy

```
Window (Frame)
├── Header / Tab bar
├── Body
│   ├── (Tab 1)
│   │   ├── Panel (Block)
│   │   │   └── Table / Chart / Paragraph
│   │   └── Panel (Block)
│   │       └── Detail view
│   ├── (Tab 2)
│   │   └── ...
│   └── ...
└── Status bar / Footer
```

