## Data Flow

### Primary Refresh Cycle

```
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ {{Data Source}}         │
└────────┬────────────────┘
         │
         ├─→ {{Load frequency}} Load
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ App::data (Snapshot)    │
└────────┬────────────────┘
         │
         ├─→ Filter (search)
         ├─→ Sort (column)
         ├─→ Paginate (if needed)
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ Render (current_tab)    │
│ - Widget::render()      │
│ - StatefulWidget::render()
└─────────────────────────┘
```

### Async Operations

Operations that run in background threads:

| Operation | Trigger | State | Timeout |
|-----------|---------|-------|---------|
| {{Operation}} | {{When triggered}} | `Arc<Mutex<{{State}}>>` | {{Duration}} |

**Example:**
```
Chart fetch: when user presses 'c' on Signals tab
  → spawn thread → fetch_intraday.py → write ChartState::Ready/Error
  → main loop detects state change → re-render
```

